  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Punjab Health Sector Reform Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the proposed project is to support the implementation of the Punjab Health Sector Strategy, by focusing on the improvement of the coverage and utilization of quality essential health services, particularly in the low performing districts of Punjab. The project will focus on building the capacity and systems to strengthen accountability and stewardship in DoH.</narrative>
  </description>
